    "summary": {
     "cost": 100,
     "text": "A talented teen exorcist meets her match when she unwittingly seduces the heir to a demon clan!\n\nAsaki Hibana's reputation precedes her. She's the brilliantly talented heir to the prestigious Hibana Clan of exorcists, but her ability to see the supernatural and the pressure placed on her by her family isolates her. Miserable, she makes a deal with her father: If she can capture the heir to the demon Yatagarasu Clan, she can finally be free to be a normal high school girl. \n\nEnergized by the prospect of making friends and not being ostracized as the creepy girl who can see the supernatural, Asaki starts gathering intelligence on the Yatagarasu Clan. But before she can make any moves, a handsome boy with big glossy black wings appears offering help. Could he be her first ally, or is he hiding something sinister?\n\nNotes:\n\n- Originally a one-shot published in LaLa 2024 Nov. issue, a two-part continuation was published in LaLa 2025 March and April. A full serialization was announced on 2025-02-21 and started in LaLa 2025 June issue.\n\n- Includes one extra chapter."
